{
  "$schema": "https://open-design.ai/schemas/plugin.v1.json",
  "specVersion": "1.0.0",
  "name": "community-huashu-bento-insight",
  "title": "Bento Insight Grid",
  "title_i18n": {
    "en": "Bento Insight Grid",
    "zh-CN": "便当格洞见"
  },
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Apple Keynote / QBR-school bento decks: light-grey #F5F5F7 and cream pages, unequal-height rounded cards with 1px hairlines and micro shadows, one insight per card (giant Geist Mono tabular numeral, linear inline-SVG icon, or SVG sparkline), oversized display headlines with hard weight contrast, Inter/Geist typography on a fixed 1920×1080 canvas. Based on https://github.com/alchaincyf/huashu-design design-styles.md bento-grid spec (Bento便当格模块网格, neutral school, 95% fidelity), generated from the spec into a full multi-section deck.",
  "description_i18n": {
    "en": "Apple Keynote / QBR-school bento decks: light-grey #F5F5F7 and cream pages, unequal-height rounded cards with 1px hairlines and micro shadows, one insight per card (giant Geist Mono tabular numeral, linear inline-SVG icon, or SVG sparkline), oversized display headlines with hard weight contrast, Inter/Geist typography on a fixed 1920×1080 canvas. Based on https://github.com/alchaincyf/huashu-design design-styles.md bento-grid spec (Bento便当格模块网格, neutral school, 95% fidelity), generated from the spec into a full multi-section deck.",
    "zh-CN": "Apple Keynote/QBR 流派便当格幻灯片：#F5F5F7 浅灰与奶白底、不等高圆角卡片网格（1px 细描边 + 微阴影）、每卡一个洞见（巨型 Geist Mono 等宽数字 / 线性 SVG 图标 / SVG sparkline）、超大 display 标题强字重对比、Inter/Geist 字体、1920×1080 固定画布、零外部 JS 依赖。基于花叔 huashu-design design-styles.md「Bento便当格模块网格」规格（中性派 · 还原95%）按 spec 生成完整多章节 deck。"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": {
    "name": "花叔 (alchaincyf)",
    "url": "https://github.com/alchaincyf"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/alchaincyf/huashu-design",
  "plugin": {
    "repo": "https://github.com/alchaincyf/huashu-design"
  },
  "tags": [
    "community",
    "deck",
    "slides",
    "ppt",
    "presentation",
    "bento",
    "keynote",
    "qbr",
    "data-report",
    "minimal",
    "huashu"
  ],
  "compat": {
    "agentSkills": [
      {
        "path": "./SKILL.md"
      }
    ]
  },
  "od": {
    "kind": "scenario",
    "taskKind": "new-generation",
    "mode": "deck",
    "scenario": "product",
    "surface": "web",
    "preview": {
      "type": "html",
      "entry": "./example.html",
      "motion": "deck"
    },
    "useCase": {
      "query": {
        "en": "Create a bento-grid {{deckType}} for {{audience}} about {{topic}} with {{slideCount}}, using the Bento Insight Grid system (based on the huashu-design design-styles.md Bento Grid spec — Apple Keynote Bento era / MBB Big-Type decks / Stripe metric-card matrices / Pitch.com QBR lineage): a fixed 1920×1080 canvas auto-scaled to the viewport; pages alternating light-grey #F5F5F7 and warm cream #FBFAF7 backgrounds; white/tinted/dark cards with 24–32px border-radius, 1px #E8E8ED hairline, and a micro two-layer shadow; the Inter/Geist + Geist Mono stack from a single Google Fonts @import (the only external reference — no other CDN, no Chart.js, no icon fonts, no emoji); exactly three accents — brand #0071E3 (re-themeable) plus green #1FA958 for positive deltas and orange #F08A24 for caution, never a fourth. Every bento page is an unequal-height CSS grid (6 columns × 1.18fr/1fr rows, mixed spans, one tall span-2 hero card — at most 1 dark #1D1D1F card and 2 tinted cards per page, ≤ 7 cards total); every card holds exactly one insight: a 14px/600 muted label plus one protagonist — a tabular-nums Geist Mono numeral with muted .unit span and rounded ↑/↓ delta pill, a 52px tinted chip with a 1.8-stroke linear inline-SVG icon, or an inline-SVG sparkline (polyline + 14%-opacity area fill). Bar charts are pure CSS flex columns of rounded bars, current period in brand blue, history in #E4E4E9, mono values printed above. Headlines pair 800–900 weight spans with 300–400 thin spans in the same line; kickers are 14px uppercase mono with 3px tracking in brand color. Draw layouts from the locked enumeration: cover (cream, 130–150px display statement + mini KPI card strip) / agenda / master bento / one-insight (300–380px mono numeral, unit glyph in brand) / chart / feature-bento with icon chips / quote (brand SVG quote marks, key phrase in brand) / stats-2x2 / roadmap tracks / closing — use at least 5 distinct layouts across 8–11 pages. Build a single self-contained HTML file by copying example.html and replacing content only — keep its design tokens, grid skeletons, card anatomy, and navigation script (←/→/Space keys, #/N hash routing, click zones, counter pill) intact. Use the user's real numbers, never lorem ipsum or invented data; keep the orange caution treatment for negative metrics; Chinese copy uses 「」 quotes and idiomatic zh-CN; replace all fictional 澄流/ClearFlow demo content.",
        "zh-CN": "用「便当格洞见」体系为 {{audience}} 做一套关于 {{topic}} 的 {{deckType}}（页数 {{slideCount}}）：1920×1080 固定画布、#F5F5F7 浅灰与奶白底交替、不等高圆角便当卡（1px 细描边 + 微阴影、每页至多 1 张深色卡 2 张浅彩卡）、每卡只装一个洞见（Geist Mono 等宽巨数 + 涨跌胶囊 / 线性 SVG 图标 / SVG sparkline）、超大 display 标题粗细字重同行对比、品牌蓝 #0071E3 + 绿 #1FA958 + 橙 #F08A24 三色封顶，版式从封面/目录/便当主版/单洞见巨数/图表/功能便当/引语/2×2 指标/路线图/结尾枚举中至少取 5 种。从 example.html 复制出单文件、只换内容，保留 token、网格骨架、卡片解剖和导航脚本；用真实数据、负向指标保留橙色警示、替换全部「澄流 ClearFlow」演示内容。完整规格以英文版为准（follow the en query above）。"
      },
      "exampleOutputs": [
        {
          "path": "./example.html",
          "title": "Bento Insight Grid",
          "title_i18n": {
            "en": "Bento Insight Grid",
            "zh-CN": "便当格洞见"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "inputs": [
      {
        "name": "deckType",
        "label": "Deck type",
        "type": "select",
        "required": true,
        "options": [
          "QBR / business review deck",
          "product feature summary deck",
          "sales results deck",
          "town hall metrics deck",
          "annual report deck"
        ],
        "default": "QBR / business review deck"
      },
      {
        "name": "topic",
        "label": "Topic",
        "type": "string",
        "required": true,
        "placeholder": "你的主题，例如：2026 Q2 业务回顾",
        "default": "the user's brief"
      },
      {
        "name": "audience",
        "label": "Audience",
        "type": "string",
        "required": true,
        "placeholder": "管理层 / 全员大会 / 客户高层",
        "default": "leadership"
      },
      {
        "name": "slideCount",
        "label": "Pages",
        "type": "select",
        "required": true,
        "options": [
          "8 pages",
          "9-10 pages",
          "10-11 pages"
        ],
        "default": "9-10 pages"
      }
    ],
    "context": {
      "skills": [
        {
          "path": "./SKILL.md"
        }
      ],
      "assets": [
        "./example.html"
      ]
    },
    "pipeline": {
      "stages": [
        {
          "id": "discovery",
          "atoms": [
            "discovery-question-form"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "generate",
          "atoms": [
            "file-write",
            "live-artifact"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "capabilities": [
      "prompt:inject",
      "fs:write"
    ]
  }
}
